# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies, so secrets (.env,
# tokens), the local venv and caches can never leak into an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/

# Re-exclude build litter inside the allowed tree.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
